#!/usr/bin/env perl
use strict;
use warnings;

use FindBin qw($Bin);
use lib "$Bin/../lib";

use Browser::CLI ();

exit Browser::CLI::main( method => 'PDF', argv => \@ARGV );

__END__

=head1 NAME

browser.pdf - Capture a full-page PDF with Playwright

=head1 SYNOPSIS

  dashboard browser.pdf <url> [OPTIONS]

Chromium-based browsers only (chrome, chromium, edge) - Playwright's PDF
export (Chromium DevTools' printToPDF) has no Firefox/WebKit support.

See SKILLS.md (or C<dashboard browser.skills>) for the full flag reference
and result payload shape.

=head1 EXIT STATUS

C<0> on success; C<2> on a usage error or an unhandled request failure.

=cut
